{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"And what good would it do if they didn't listen? People are not tools, they decide for themselves. As much as you would think you could have changed an outcome, you shoukd stay humble in the fact that you didn't. Self pity solves nothing.\" He knocks on his chest over his symbol","created_at":"2020-07-27T15:22:48.444000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737329150716805191","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
