{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Yes, but many are to blame for others' mistakes as well. My father... he was a devil. I was convinced for so long that he was a hero, but he enslaved people, tricking them into becoming winged, horned servants.\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T15:35:50.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737332432797433966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
